---
---
<section aria-label="Reflection" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: #F7F7F4; color: #251F19; font-family: var(--font-text); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">

  <div style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: var(--accent);">
    <figure style="box-sizing: border-box; max-width: calc(1280px + 2 * var(--gutter)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 10vw, 140px) var(--gutter); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px;">
      <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #A9C4E4;">Reflection</span>
      <blockquote style="margin: 0; padding: 0;">
        <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 1080px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 56px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #FFFFFF;">&#8220;RBAC is not a feature. It&#8217;s a foundational constraint that shapes navigation, component rendering, and system feedback from day one.&#8221;</p>
      </blockquote>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="refl" style="box-sizing: border-box; max-width: calc(1280px + 2 * var(--gutter)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px) var(--gutter);">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #251F19;">Learnings</h2>
      <ol aria-label="Learnings" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">01</span><span>Designing for multi-tenant systems requires strong system thinking and role-based UX.</span></li>
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">02</span><span>The biggest challenge was not any single screen, but making every pattern (tables, side panels, status indicators) hold its meaning consistently across 5 role contexts.</span></li>
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">03</span><span>Ambiguity at the system level creates confusion at the interaction level.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 2.8vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #251F19;">Next steps</h2>
      <ol aria-label="Next steps" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">01</span><span>Enhance visual design fidelity across the full component library.</span></li>
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">02</span><span>Introduce AI-assisted features, such as resume parsing and smart candidate matching, as a Phase 2 layer.</span></li>
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">03</span><span>Optimize recruiter workflows for mobile, since sourcing increasingly happens off-desk.</span></li>
            <li style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 12px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #EBE8E4; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3B342D;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #756D64; padding-top: 2px;">04</span><span>First moderated walkthroughs underway; full validation with real recruiters next.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
.refl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(48px,6vw,80px)}
.refl>div{max-width:920px}
</style>
